OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed for murder 16 years
OL,4,Aafter attacking teen
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been jailed for murder after
OL,7,Fhis victim died 16 years after the
OL,8,Foriginal attack.
OL,10,FJordan Burton, now aged 33, was 14 when
OL,11,Fhe caused a serious head injury to
OL,12,FDaniel Allright, then 16, in Lewisham,
OL,13,Fsouth-east London.
OL,15,FAllright suffered an epileptic seizure
OL,16,Fsix months after the attack in 2006,
OL,17,Fand the condition persisted and then
OL,18,Fworsened before his death.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
